<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-19T22:32:07.418Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:32:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Recent days have seen a deadly attack on a military convoy in Borno that left 15 soldiers dead, and a bomb explosion on a Borno road that killed nine soldiers. In Benue, police rescued an abducted Catholic priest and seven others, while in Plateau Fulani communities faced house burnings amid ethnic-cleansing concerns. Zamfara experienced a false claim of an attack on the deputy governor and police rescued two abducted victims while recovering livestock. These incidents add to the ongoing bandit raids, ISWAP land-mine attacks and kidnappings previously reported. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPTXZOZlFXZVZMeFpHRTNuRUw1b2pzaDVXT1gzdzJBdzJVVF9KMk9ZTWpPeVhKbC1RVy00TTR2eFVzbmJwVFAwc1V5cjZ1SFhOOUc5TVBxcFk0TjJzck1pcFBseGxObzF2Zml4Y1NHZGtSQ29SOHp4TTFzNm50REVmYVRSLW13SklfNjlfQXhrZ0J1RGZQR19YR0ZiMFo0azMz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxNdHZKdTdRNGtEbW1qcUxZRWhqbzNJSFpFa2dMNUl4dHRsZWNKanBJS0ZjVzZYYVRBcVUtUWtPc2dPSVdfMmN5SVlrQU9TcTFVUGF3T2pTSnpZY1hwdUtoalNiQ0tWaWptWnNrTFJ6TlltUTdiR1R4RzNfUmFHbWNaT3ZxWkQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;thefact.ng&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQdm1HbjVoZlo1Y3EyZ2hyMDhKdHd3UTBkeHBEV1B5X2NzLVl3dUU5Z2pzYUFBeHZ6VXdEaWNtdWZLdTBMSnl3SktNVExiMGw3UzBTX0lFbmZsZUZJMlc5Ny1FTEVZX1RKWDZHLWZ1Mm9TMU1aMHVBckJLaWhCOGVKTHBSQ1Y4OWkxeW5jUmxzV1hueEpmSEhSQ1pBUUUzVzZPQ0VSMGpLTVQ5WHkzcXM0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPOHBEVFpZYjlaajFtZjhHLTFFbVE0MFYtMUM5RTg5d1hwRVBwanlWbUJyWVMyQndneGNWdEltMHNuaklUN2U1V1E3SGJCSVNBTWtaWjgyNndvX21jTmNSVU9HdW82b1BOeDVKR1cyTTNuc09FX3VUcExNbFpKeVVPMUFvaWJGWkZnOTlSOGFjTWR5VW5EcFhyVFR0WF9DeU